  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child Grant UN Joint Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Government of Mozambique Child Grant programme. The programme follows a &#x2018;cash and care&#x2019; methodology and includes three components, namely: cash transfers to vulnerable families with children under 2 years old, social behaviour changes communication (SBCC) on stunting reduction and case management for the most vulnerable.</narrative>
  </description>
